<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-BOLAND 120-7 AT TEA AGAINST NATAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BOLAND 120-7 AT TEA AGAINST NATAL.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boland were 120 for seven in their first innings at tea on the opening day of their four-day Supersport Series cricket match against Natal at Kingsmead on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Boland 120-7 in 63 overs (David Millns 34 not out, Claude Henderson 21 not out; Gary Gilder 3-25, Shaun Pollock 2-20, Tertius Bosch 2-27).</p>
